Founder-model provenance
------------------------

The gsim founder model is a clean native C++ implementation informed by the
scientific model and behavior of HAPNEST. No HAPNEST source code is included.
The reference source was inspected at the pinned revision:

https://github.com/intervene-EU-H2020/synthetic_data/tree/ba52da1a63cf609306ea92540b3d130fa1efd213

The corresponding paper is Wharrie et al. (2023), "HAPNEST: efficient,
large-scale generation and evaluation of synthetic datasets for human
genetics", Bioinformatics 39, btad535:

https://doi.org/10.1093/bioinformatics/btad535

HAPNEST is distributed under GPL-3; its license at the pinned revision is:

https://github.com/intervene-EU-H2020/synthetic_data/blob/ba52da1a63cf609306ea92540b3d130fa1efd213/LICENSE

